  "_note": "Wayback 20260317173320 (11:33 MDT): snow-reports, lifts, trails; sensors = weather-forecast.sensors from the same capture (same object as /dor/sensors). No terrains capture that day. Trimmed to the fields snowbird.ts reads.",
  "report": [
    {"date":"2026-03-17 05:31:48","updated":1773749902,"overnight_amount":0,"base_depth":88,"computed":{"24_hour":0,"48_hour":0,"72_hour":0,"7_day":0,"total":248},"report":"<p dir=\"ltr\"><br>Top of the mornin' to ya Snowbird! It’s Owen, with your snow report for&nbsp;Tuesday.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">Alright people, time to queue up some Dropkick Murphys and put on your best green outfits, it’s St. Patrick’s Day today. To compliment the day, we’ll have nice sunny skies and a warm 55° up on the mountain. Expect spring skiing conditions today, especially later in the day when temperatures begin to rise. It’s going to be a fun one today.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">After you’re done on the slopes, hit the Tram Club for our <a href=\"https://www.snowbird.com/activities-events/events/events-calendar/tram-club-st-patricks/\">St. Patrick’s Day Celebration</a>. There will be live music from 4-7, Irish drinks and maybe some swag giveaways if you’re feeling lucky. It's what St. Patrick himself would have wanted.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">ALL uphill travel is closed. Don’t be that guy (or gal). Please remember to ski and ride in control, if you don’t, you’re gonna have a bad time.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\">That’s the snow report and if you don’t like it, too bad. I’ll be here all season. Except for Fridays and Saturdays - I’m off those days.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">#GMTB</p>"}
